      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRULY LOYAL (9) has strung together a couple of wins at this course, the latest on September 5 over 1200m when he scored by just over a length. Meets a field of more experienced rivals but looks to have more upside than most and it would be a surprise if she didn't measure up. SILENT DIVA (5) is another progressive type in good form. Ran on strongly only to just miss as favourite last start over 1400m at this track and gets the chance to go one better. FIFTH ESSENCE (4) finished fifth, beaten 1.5 lengths, last time out over this course and distance after coming from an outside draw. Likely to push forward and race on the pace. FAMOUS DAIN (1) resumes but has a great first-up record and loves 1400m so could show up.",
